WEBVTT

00:43.570 --> 00:47.000
I'm a secret government agent.

00:47.630 --> 00:49.730
I must complete my mission.

00:51.000 --> 00:55.000
This world has beings that came from another dimension.

00:55.000 --> 01:00.000
Even though they have a human appearance, they rage and kill us.

01:00.140 --> 01:03.270
That's why I have to eradicate them!

01:05.000 --> 01:08.000
You think so too, right?

01:08.440 --> 01:09.280
Hey...

01:10.500 --> 01:13.120
You think so too...right?

01:13.130 --> 01:16.100
Tell me you think so too!! Alright?!

01:17.760 --> 01:19.470
...YEAH

01:21.000 --> 01:23.500
I knew you would understand.

01:23.500 --> 01:27.500
That's right. I'm a secret government agent.

01:27.500 --> 01:30.000
I must fulfil my duty.

01:28.230 --> 01:33.780
I wonder if I'm pitiful...?

01:41.870 --> 01:44.370
Juuzawa Juu.

01:41.870 --> 01:44.370
He is king.

01:48.500 --> 01:50.750
He's a lone wolf. Ruler of himself.

01:53.000 --> 01:56.500
I told you before, right? I don't intend to join you.

01:56.500 --> 02:00.000
If you still want me, I'll take you on.

02:00.000 --> 02:02.500
Whenever and however.

02:01.680 --> 02:03.310
If it's him, surely...

02:07.560 --> 02:13.070
Denpa Teki na Kanojo

02:07.560 --> 02:13.070
Senpachi Fansubs presents

02:10.500 --> 02:13.000
Wait up, Juuzawa Juu!

02:13.070 --> 02:17.000
How many times do I have to say it? School rules say your hair is against right?

02:17.000 --> 02:20.000
Hey, Fujishima, you really like me that much?

02:21.000 --> 02:23.000
Of course that's not right!

02:23.500 --> 02:26.000
Sorry, my mistake.

02:26.000 --> 02:28.000
You really hate me that much?

02:28.000 --> 02:30.000
Hate! I <i>really</i> hate you!

02:30.000 --> 02:31.000
Regrettable.

02:35.000 --> 02:36.620
Got it, Juuzawa Juu?

02:36.640 --> 02:40.000
If it's not changed tomorrow, I'll report you to the student counseling!

02:40.000 --> 02:41.500
You better come prepared!

02:46.000 --> 02:49.000
I NEED TO TALK TO YOU. AFTER SCHOOL, I'LL WAIT FOR YOU UNDER THE HUNDRED YEAR OLD CHERRY BLOSSOM TREE.

02:49.000 --> 02:50.870
These guys again...

03:08.500 --> 03:11.500
You are Lord Juuzawa Juu, am I correct?

03:11.500 --> 03:13.500
Yeah, that's right.

03:13.500 --> 03:15.000
I have been waiting for you.

03:15.000 --> 03:16.000
Oh, really?

03:16.000 --> 03:17.500
I really wanted to see you.

03:17.850 --> 03:20.000
You know, what--

03:20.000 --> 03:22.000
My body is in your possession.

03:22.000 --> 03:24.500
My heart is your slave.

03:24.500 --> 03:30.000
My king, Lord Juuzawa Juu. I pledge my eternal faithfulness.

03:34.000 --> 03:36.000
Who.... the hell are you?!

03:36.000 --> 03:38.000
I am Lord Juu's servant.

03:38.000 --> 03:40.500
Servant?! What's up with "servant"?!

03:40.500 --> 03:43.340
A human who labors for your sake.

03:43.340 --> 03:45.000
What labor?

03:45.000 --> 03:47.000
I will do anything.

03:47.000 --> 03:49.350
Anything you say....You---

03:49.350 --> 03:52.080
It's anything. As long as it's for Lord Juu.

03:59.500 --> 04:01.000
Lord Juu!

04:02.260 --> 04:05.260
PEOPLE HIDE THEIR TRUE SELVES INSIDE

04:08.000 --> 04:10.020
WHEN EACH ONE IS STRIPPED RAW.

04:11.000 --> 04:13.700
Spare my life.... I'm begging you!

04:14.770 --> 04:17.270
I WONDER WHAT HE'LL SHOW ME?

04:33.000 --> 04:34.200
You!

04:34.390 --> 04:36.050
So you were here?

04:36.490 --> 04:38.200
Why are you following me?!

04:38.500 --> 04:41.330
I am your servant and your knight.

04:41.370 --> 04:44.150
It's given that I should be near your side.

04:44.160 --> 04:45.260
Damn it...

04:49.820 --> 04:50.680
Lord Juu!

04:51.980 --> 04:53.060
Juu?

04:54.380 --> 04:57.850
Did you forget? It's your turn for cleaning duty.

04:57.990 --> 04:59.820
I even brought the trash out...

05:00.000 --> 05:02.250
Ah... sorry.

05:02.660 --> 05:04.490
You owe me a favor, okay?

05:05.080 --> 05:09.780
Oh yeah...I'll give you my forgiveness if you come with me next time!

05:09.790 --> 05:11.080
Why do I have to?

05:11.150 --> 05:14.710
Because it's scary these days! There are killers running around.

05:15.000 --> 05:19.190
These murders aren't that rare. Like the organ-stealing killers.

05:19.220 --> 05:21.370
If you're scared of every one of them, you won't be able to go out.

05:22.800 --> 05:24.300
How cold...

05:25.000 --> 05:26.900
Juu, are you a tsundere?

05:27.200 --> 05:28.820
Who are you calling a tsundere?

05:29.000 --> 05:32.830
You're being "my pace" as usual...

05:32.840 --> 05:34.830
The one who is "my pace" is you.

05:34.970 --> 05:36.310
Getting in my business.

05:38.830 --> 05:41.500
You sure are thickheaded, Juu!

05:50.000 --> 05:52.000
NOT ENOUGH...

05:55.250 --> 05:57.250
NOT YET... IT HASN'T REACHED HIM YET...

06:02.000 --> 06:05.250
Juu, looks like you're having another boy's lunch again.

06:08.440 --> 06:09.870
Give me your pickled radish!

06:10.340 --> 06:12.740
Hey, you can't just take it!

06:12.870 --> 06:15.000
This is delicious though.

06:15.220 --> 06:17.030
I like how it does a "crunch".

06:17.770 --> 06:22.940
In exchange, I shall give you Satsuki Miya's special Mini-Hamburg steak!

06:23.120 --> 06:24.670
What are you trying to say?

06:24.870 --> 06:27.950
I'm saying that I love pickled vegetables.

06:32.410 --> 06:34.740
Hold up, Juuzawa Juu!

06:35.000 --> 06:37.080
You think it's alright to ditch your cleaning duty?

06:37.080 --> 06:41.500
Fujishima, I'll do it for him. Can't you give him a break this time?

06:41.500 --> 06:43.500
That's not the point at all!

06:43.500 --> 06:44.470
Please, stop there.

06:48.910 --> 06:50.890
Are you Lord Juu's enemy?

06:51.000 --> 06:53.660
Lord? Enemy? What's going on?

06:53.650 --> 06:55.810
Answer. Or else--

06:55.810 --> 06:56.760
You--

06:56.910 --> 07:00.290
If you are Lord Juu's enemy, I will get rid of you.

07:01.400 --> 07:03.790
Lord Juu's enemy is my enemy.

07:03.860 --> 07:07.930
That reason for that is Lord Juu and I are linked from our previous lives by a strong bond.

07:07.930 --> 07:08.980
Stop this already!

07:12.390 --> 07:14.310
Why do you keep bothering me?!

07:14.480 --> 07:16.880
That's because Lord Juu is my master.

07:17.860 --> 07:20.740
Alright, let me take this a little slower.

07:21.000 --> 07:23.500
Right, your name?

07:24.200 --> 07:26.950
Oh, sorry there was no introduction.

07:27.120 --> 07:29.000
In this life, my name is --

07:29.500 --> 07:31.370
Ochibana Ame.

07:32.590 --> 07:34.750
What do you mean, "in this life"?

07:35.000 --> 07:38.520
Literally, it means this life has this name.

07:40.130 --> 07:42.690
Explain clearly why you're always following me.

07:43.000 --> 07:44.560
So that I can understand.

07:44.740 --> 07:48.470
If you can't, I don't want to see you around me ever again.

07:49.000 --> 07:50.160
Understood.

07:57.760 --> 08:00.000
That's all. The explanation ends.

08:05.000 --> 08:11.000
So, however many thousand years ago, I was king of a Continent called Lemuria.

08:11.250 --> 08:17.500
You were my loyal friend and we struggled to have a balanced life.

08:18.000 --> 08:21.000
Overall, that is right.

08:22.470 --> 08:25.000
I get it. You're weird.

08:25.000 --> 08:30.000
Really? I was scolded in my previous life for being bad at receiving jokes.

08:30.000 --> 08:31.520
That's not what I mean!

08:32.000 --> 08:33.500
You're wrong in the head!

08:33.500 --> 08:36.270
Don't bring me into these ridiculous delusions!

08:36.400 --> 08:39.760
Lord Juu, could it be that your memories haven't returned yet?

08:39.760 --> 08:41.170
I didn't have them to start with!

08:41.230 --> 08:44.930
I'm shocked. This might be a conspiracy--

08:44.930 --> 08:46.160
Stop!

08:46.680 --> 08:48.410
Kings? Swords? Magic?

08:48.680 --> 08:50.500
Don't stick with these stupid delusions!

09:04.540 --> 09:08.000
Continuing the news, a report on the murders with the recent killers.

09:08.000 --> 09:13.000
Eleven victims have been claimed these past few months.

09:13.500 --> 09:16.500
And another incident happened last night.

09:17.430 --> 09:20.000
The victim was Shirota Eri.

09:20.000 --> 09:23.000
Ms. Shirota was attacked on her way from work to home.

09:23.000 --> 09:28.500
Her whole body was beaten by a bat then she was strangled to her death by an unknown rope-like object.

09:28.500 --> 09:30.500
The police think these incidents---

10:01.870 --> 10:02.790
Mom...

10:17.170 --> 10:20.670
Good evening, Lord Juu. Sorry for intruding at this late time.

10:20.680 --> 10:22.280
H...How did you get in?

10:22.600 --> 10:25.970
The window was open, so I walked in normally.

10:26.000 --> 10:27.000
You--

10:27.290 --> 10:29.160
Don't tell me you climbed up the scaffolding?

10:29.740 --> 10:33.780
Yes, I felt you needed me, so I came as soon as I could--

10:33.790 --> 10:34.720
I didn't call for you!

10:34.890 --> 10:35.980
Telepathy, right?

10:36.000 --> 10:36.850
It doesn't exist!

10:36.920 --> 10:38.090
The bonds from our previous lives.

10:38.250 --> 10:39.250
Only with you!

10:39.500 --> 10:42.000
Just finding my address and entering without permission--

10:42.000 --> 10:43.000
Get out right now!

10:45.880 --> 10:49.000
Lord Juu, do you always live in this room alone?

10:49.000 --> 10:50.500
What if I do?!

10:50.500 --> 10:52.000
Where might your parents be?

10:52.000 --> 10:53.000
Nothing to do with you!

10:53.000 --> 10:56.000
Sure, I'm alone but don't pity me.

10:56.000 --> 10:57.000
Alright?!

10:57.000 --> 10:59.500
I don't want anything from you because I'm weak.

10:59.500 --> 11:03.500
I understand. Lord Juu is not weak.

11:04.000 --> 11:06.000
That's why you aren't afraid of isolation.

11:07.870 --> 11:09.690
Please believe me.

11:10.000 --> 11:14.000
When I'm with you, I won't let you feel lonely.

11:14.360 --> 11:16.660
I will remove all your enemies.

11:17.000 --> 11:20.230
Because I exist only for you.

11:20.500 --> 11:21.500
Get out.

11:21.500 --> 11:23.500
Hurry up and leave here!

11:25.000 --> 11:25.930
Understood.

11:37.000 --> 11:38.230
What's going on here...

13:07.290 --> 13:09.500
Fu...Fujishima...

13:11.000 --> 13:12.500
Fujishima?

13:23.880 --> 13:26.000
This was done by the serial killer, right?

13:27.000 --> 13:28.000
You--

13:28.000 --> 13:30.500
This fell to the ground nearby.

13:32.500 --> 13:34.500
Ochibana...Ame?

13:45.470 --> 13:46.700
Did you do it?

13:47.060 --> 13:49.190
Was it you that killed Fujishima Kanako?

13:52.600 --> 13:53.750
I did not kill her.

13:54.180 --> 13:55.040
Really?

13:55.500 --> 13:57.800
That sure took a while to say.

13:58.000 --> 13:59.940
I didn't expect a question like that.

14:00.000 --> 14:02.000
It was a little shocking.

14:02.000 --> 14:03.500
Which part are you talking about?

14:03.950 --> 14:05.960
The thing about me thinking it was you?

14:06.620 --> 14:10.500
The fact you are investigating Fujishima Kanako's death.

14:12.470 --> 14:13.910
You saw it right?!

14:14.490 --> 14:15.360
She...

14:16.400 --> 14:20.220
I won't forgive an irresponsible guy like you!

14:20.310 --> 14:22.310
I'm fine even if you don't forgive me.

14:22.500 --> 14:24.530
Don't say just say things that are convenient for you!

14:33.000 --> 14:36.360
Juuzawa...do you have any dreams?

14:36.500 --> 14:37.920
Any goals for the future?

14:37.940 --> 14:39.000
I don't have any.

14:43.000 --> 14:46.630
Even I have a dream...I...

14:47.000 --> 14:51.000
That girl...wanted to be a translator, she said.

14:51.000 --> 14:57.000
It's bothering you to know the reason she was killed, am I correct?

14:58.000 --> 14:59.000
Yeah...

14:59.000 --> 15:01.500
In that case, would you like to accompany me?

15:03.640 --> 15:05.440
I will show you something.

15:10.150 --> 15:14.760
Hey, why does the culprit want to be a phantom killer?

15:15.500 --> 15:18.900
To be killed for no reason...what a joke.

15:22.630 --> 15:24.500
I think there is a reason.

15:24.500 --> 15:26.000
For those people to have been killed?

15:26.000 --> 15:28.500
No, for the culprit.

15:30.380 --> 15:33.660
I assumed he just wanted to vent on those victims.

15:34.310 --> 15:39.000
Sometimes there are people who get angry for no reason and blame others for it.

15:40.020 --> 15:49.040
If that was the case, our culprit with no reason kills randomly and repeats.

15:49.500 --> 15:53.000
But the culprit will get problematic stress.

15:53.110 --> 15:55.080
So you think some other reason exists?

15:55.720 --> 16:00.110
Most likely, it's something that makes killing not an issue about feelings.

16:00.370 --> 16:02.000
So the culprit is abnormal?

16:02.220 --> 16:05.000
Even if he's abnormal or has a disorder, rules still exist.

16:05.190 --> 16:08.000
Perfect irrationality does not exist.

16:09.340 --> 16:12.500
Then who do you think the culprit is?

16:12.830 --> 16:16.200
Must be a human with some sort of mission, I assume.

16:17.500 --> 16:23.500
For example, something like someone who thinks themselves a knight working for a king?

16:25.070 --> 16:27.320
That possibility can't be discarded.

16:29.540 --> 16:30.150
Just...

16:30.590 --> 16:31.230
Just?

16:31.500 --> 16:34.500
I don't think the culprit is working alone.

16:34.590 --> 16:38.600
Note: DVDs are "Kure-nai" which is a spin-off series in the same world.

16:48.020 --> 16:48.770
This is it.

16:59.430 --> 17:00.420
You...

17:01.670 --> 17:07.000
Two weeks ago, this was a picture of one of the killer's victims.

17:07.000 --> 17:09.500
How do you have this here?

17:11.510 --> 17:15.300
It's wide around on the Net. On various image boards.

17:16.900 --> 17:21.260
Looking at the specifics, there's no mistake the main culprit is male.

17:22.390 --> 17:24.570
However what bothers me is the wire.

17:25.780 --> 17:31.000
Compared to the simple crude way of beating to death, this is different.

17:31.500 --> 17:35.900
There was a need to visually confirm that the victims died.

17:36.060 --> 17:40.000
About Fujishima...you were questioned about her murder, right?

17:42.000 --> 17:44.000
At that time, did they say it?

17:44.000 --> 17:47.500
No, from the start I wasn't intended to be aided by the police.

17:47.500 --> 17:48.500
Why?

17:48.500 --> 17:50.500
There are too many cases.

17:48.520 --> 17:50.560
Tumbling Doll Murder.

17:51.000 --> 17:55.500
Cases show up more often than we can deal with.

17:51.360 --> 17:53.650
Home Delivery Kidnapping Murder.

17:54.360 --> 17:56.400
Serial Killings of the Homeless.

17:56.100 --> 17:58.000
We're in a world with something wrong

17:57.110 --> 17:59.250
Organ-Stealing Killer.

17:58.000 --> 17:59.500
Something's broken.

18:00.000 --> 18:04.500
Lord Juu, do you want to catch the culprit?

18:10.000 --> 18:11.900
That's not the case.

18:18.500 --> 18:20.500
I'm relieved with that.

18:20.890 --> 18:21.550
Yeah.

18:22.000 --> 18:26.500
In that case, you'll be fine seeing this right?

18:38.570 --> 18:39.450
Shit!

18:50.270 --> 18:52.860
IT REACHED HIM...

18:56.050 --> 18:59.000
Lord Juu, do you want to catch the culprit?

18:59.910 --> 19:02.000
Yeah, I want to catch him.

19:13.710 --> 19:16.050
Meeting someone? Who?

19:16.380 --> 19:18.800
I don't think the culprit is working alone.

19:19.150 --> 19:20.000
Don't tell me--

19:25.950 --> 19:27.420
A woman?

19:29.550 --> 19:33.000
Repent! Villian! Delinquent! Brute!

19:33.270 --> 19:34.000
Pervert!

19:34.000 --> 19:36.380
Dull brain! Shredded Nattou!

19:36.380 --> 19:40.500
If only you weren't here then my older sister wouldn't have weird fantasies!

19:40.500 --> 19:43.500
You're that girl's little sister?

19:43.500 --> 19:49.320
My sister usually daydreams but ever since you came along it has gotten much worse!

19:49.690 --> 19:51.500
Everything's wrong because of you!

19:51.500 --> 19:56.000
Listen, I don't plan to go along with her wild ideas.

19:56.000 --> 19:57.500
It'd make me feel bad.

19:58.070 --> 20:00.160
Then why did you come to our house?

20:00.570 --> 20:03.930
That's......hey, Ame's little sister--

20:04.350 --> 20:05.130
It's Hikaru!

20:05.610 --> 20:10.770
Hikaru, do you know why that girl is bringing me into her delusions?

20:12.140 --> 20:14.240
You...don't know?

20:16.180 --> 20:20.760
I see. If you didn't realize, then of course you wouldn't be using her.

20:25.090 --> 20:29.710
If you lay even one finger on my sister, I'll make you regret it by casting a Buddhist Prayer!

20:30.220 --> 20:32.000
Gonna be late for practice!

20:33.210 --> 20:34.450
I don't understand her.

20:41.000 --> 20:46.520
With her sister and friends...it's somehow disheartening.

20:48.410 --> 20:50.000
Accomplices, eh?

20:50.570 --> 20:53.000
Even if there were three women...

20:54.000 --> 20:56.280
Either way, I have to start at the scene of the crime.

20:57.010 --> 20:59.500
But when? When would the culprit--

21:00.900 --> 21:03.800
Even if he's abnormal or has a disorder, he has to follow certain rules.

21:06.690 --> 21:07.390
Rules...

21:22.960 --> 21:24.970
July 3rd

21:22.960 --> 21:24.970
Partly cloudy with rain

21:26.240 --> 21:28.320
I'll be late if it's already raining.

21:29.830 --> 21:31.000
I have to confirm it.

21:54.900 --> 21:55.460
Hello...

21:57.000 --> 21:58.540
Eh? What was it?

22:04.030 --> 22:05.000
The park?

22:28.010 --> 22:30.490
You! What are you doing here?!

22:33.630 --> 22:35.660
I'm a secret government agent.

22:36.000 --> 22:39.450
Just now, I dealt with these aliens that were posing as humans.

22:41.330 --> 22:43.230
You were this guy's comrade right?

22:44.000 --> 22:47.500
If you've come to save him, you have some luck to meet me....

22:48.000 --> 22:51.000
...Let me have fun and have a battle with me!

22:51.320 --> 22:53.040
You're saying that seriously?

22:59.000 --> 23:02.910
Hey, you...have killed many people right?

23:03.390 --> 23:05.930
Do you understand what happens to people who die?!

23:06.330 --> 23:10.770
Of course. I think it's my mission to deal with you all.

23:11.000 --> 23:14.000
This is for the sake of justice! For humanity!

23:17.610 --> 23:22.080
I'll ask you one thing: you, do you know about Ochibana Ame?

23:23.040 --> 23:25.140
Who is that? Your comrade?

23:31.980 --> 23:35.000
A secret government agent you said?

23:35.770 --> 23:37.910
Then I shall tell you about me.

23:39.150 --> 23:41.580
Actually, in my previous life I was a king.

23:42.370 --> 23:45.660
How pitiful. You've gone mad.

23:46.060 --> 23:50.000
Everyone is mad. Without noticing they are mad.

23:50.000 --> 23:52.950
They don't even notice how mad the world is either!

24:07.490 --> 24:08.700
Resisting is useless.

24:09.000 --> 24:10.260
Let me end this!

24:42.920 --> 24:44.240
You--

24:45.320 --> 24:47.000
Lord Juu, are you safe?

24:47.520 --> 24:50.290
Why are you here? How did you know where I was?

24:51.000 --> 24:52.440
The entirety of our bonds.

24:55.070 --> 24:55.730
I see...

25:11.850 --> 25:15.000
Then today, you were following me too?

25:15.490 --> 25:18.380
Yes, there was a high possibility of something happening.

25:18.480 --> 25:21.330
I see. As I thought, it was about rainy days.

25:21.900 --> 25:23.000
So on that day--

25:23.940 --> 25:27.100
No, it's just the possibility of rain.

25:27.940 --> 25:33.000
On days where the incidents occurred, the probability of rain was higher than 50%

25:33.000 --> 25:35.000
Why do you--

25:36.310 --> 25:41.160
This is just my opinion, but it's most likely a condition.

25:41.870 --> 25:44.280
He's taking the probability of rain as the deciding factor.

25:44.500 --> 25:48.540
When this condition is fulfilled, only then is he allowed to kill people.

25:52.420 --> 25:53.060
Sorry.

25:53.810 --> 25:56.010
I was always thinking it was you.

25:56.700 --> 25:59.000
But it turned out you weren't.

25:59.660 --> 26:02.630
I don't mind if you hate me...or rebuke me.

26:02.950 --> 26:04.690
I won't even care if you want to hit me.

26:05.160 --> 26:09.000
Lord Juu, I don't think a reason exists that would make me hate you.

26:13.330 --> 26:13.910
But--

26:29.600 --> 26:31.320
You. Hit me.

26:32.160 --> 26:34.060
That's an order, I assume?

26:34.070 --> 26:35.000
It IS an order.

26:35.570 --> 26:37.370
Well-- Excuse me.

26:42.590 --> 26:46.230
With this, I won't say "call it even" or "forgive me"

26:47.170 --> 26:49.560
If there's something I can do for you, just tell me.

26:50.130 --> 26:51.920
Something like that isn't needed.

26:52.290 --> 26:55.000
If you have a wish just say it! That's an order!

26:55.440 --> 26:56.000
Alright.

26:59.410 --> 27:01.500
There is one wish I have.

27:02.600 --> 27:07.070
Please permit me to stay by your side.

27:12.240 --> 27:13.320
Do as you please.

27:28.170 --> 27:30.400
Thank god that criminal was caught!

27:31.120 --> 27:33.000
Except for the fact it was suicide.

27:34.050 --> 27:35.100
Thanks for that...

27:41.740 --> 27:43.300
By the way, what's up with this?

27:44.000 --> 27:45.820
Calling me out all the way over here.

27:46.000 --> 27:53.000
Umm...you see...Juu, I wanted to ask you something...or tell you...

27:56.140 --> 28:00.400
Juu...do you...like me?

28:03.120 --> 28:05.490
Hate...maybe?

28:05.700 --> 28:09.000
Uh, say, we--

28:11.810 --> 28:14.080
Seems like the medicine is working now.

28:23.660 --> 28:27.040
Hey, Juu, turn this way.

28:33.620 --> 28:36.290
Hey, did your right arm break properly?

28:36.680 --> 28:38.960
If not yet, I have to do it once more!

28:44.720 --> 28:47.790
Still moving? Once more then!

28:49.090 --> 28:53.720
Still moving I see. That's amazing. Once again!

28:54.890 --> 28:57.860
Um, after that I guess I have to break your legs, right?

28:57.940 --> 29:00.170
The bones are tough so it's troublesome.

29:00.970 --> 29:02.540
Here goes!

29:07.380 --> 29:10.340
Is it broken? Did it break properly?

29:13.000 --> 29:16.430
You....why? Why?!

29:17.110 --> 29:21.630
Juu, right now, the better person here is me.

29:22.640 --> 29:24.550
I am the best.

29:24.650 --> 29:29.090
So going against me is a no-no, okay? ^_^

29:29.960 --> 29:36.000
Well then! Even though I decided what to start with,
no matter what I do it never turns out the way I plan.

29:36.550 --> 29:40.320
I'll say everything then, so you can begin understanding.

29:41.850 --> 29:46.390
When I was a first year middle school student, I was raped...

29:47.870 --> 29:49.000
by my older brother.

29:50.850 --> 29:56.000
Not my real one though, a man who was my neighbor.

29:56.930 --> 30:00.160
He was Kakura Kiyoshi...you already know his name right?

30:05.800 --> 30:09.820
Because he was nice to me, I went to him for a lot of advice.

30:10.560 --> 30:15.370
After that...on that day...I was soiled.

30:18.460 --> 30:22.580
You know, he <i>really</i> hates reflecting and regretting.

30:22.840 --> 30:25.510
He wants to forget any unwanted things.

30:26.550 --> 30:34.110
Even though he was the one who did it, he still called to me "Poor thing, who did this to you?"

30:34.660 --> 30:39.700
Weird isn't it? I became odd...I even laughed.

30:43.490 --> 30:46.880
I wonder if it happened to me then?

30:48.150 --> 30:52.550
A middle school girl was killed in one of the killer incidents.

30:53.010 --> 30:56.210
At that time, he told me about it.

30:56.870 --> 31:01.000
"The one who did it was me."

31:01.670 --> 31:05.150
"Actually, I'm a secret government agent," he said.

31:06.300 --> 31:10.000
I knew quickly what he was trying to do.

31:10.710 --> 31:13.000
Of course, I thought to stop him.

31:13.450 --> 31:15.500
I wanted to inform the police when the crime happened.

31:16.180 --> 31:20.630
But you know, from then on, a mysterious development occurred.

31:23.020 --> 31:26.030
AT THAT TIME, THE INNER SIDES OF HUMANS WERE REVEALED.

31:29.580 --> 31:33.480
When I saw that, something fast ran through me.

31:33.640 --> 31:37.160
Without noticing, I was taking pictures in a daze until I filled the memory.

31:39.470 --> 31:42.000
Ms. Fujishima was so fun too!

31:42.420 --> 31:46.450
Because I was so overjoyed, I released them on the Net.

31:46.950 --> 31:49.000
Everyone will be pleased!

31:49.000 --> 31:51.930
DEEP INSIDE, SOMETHING LIKE THIS IS PROBABLY WHAT I WANTED.

31:52.460 --> 31:55.950
But, sometimes, he couldn't manage to kill the person.

31:56.710 --> 31:59.700
That's why I had to deal the finishing blow...

32:00.450 --> 32:03.090
With a wire..."cut"

32:04.240 --> 32:07.440
But sometimes he said he wanted to stop in the middle of it.

32:08.000 --> 32:13.420
Guess it couldn't be helped. I thought of many things to make him continue.

32:14.060 --> 32:15.000
Weather, huh?

32:15.000 --> 32:17.000
Amazing!!

32:17.820 --> 32:19.570
Juu understood!

32:21.300 --> 32:27.880
That was what I thought of. So he would precisely feel it was his mission to kill.

32:30.940 --> 32:33.630
Well then...guess it's about time to start?

32:36.540 --> 32:39.330
No-no. Show me your face properly

32:39.530 --> 32:41.000
or I can't take good pictures right?

32:41.130 --> 32:44.130
Hey, look look, face here. Show your face.

32:48.000 --> 32:50.470
Yes, you're just as I expected.

32:50.500 --> 32:55.730
Juu, you're <i>really</i> good. There wasn't a mistake about this hell.

32:55.980 --> 32:56.720
Hell?

32:58.620 --> 33:02.790
Juu, when I first saw you, you really stood out.

33:03.520 --> 33:10.000
Always by yourself beating people up, but your face said you were okay. Somehow I thought you seemed like a king.

33:10.430 --> 33:14.290
That's why I wanted to see.....inside of you.

33:16.940 --> 33:24.740
In front of your eyes lie an enchanting reality
and you don't even know what to do!
I'm sure you'll show me something amazing!

33:26.480 --> 33:30.160
For these photos, I even released myself from him!

33:31.000 --> 33:33.000
Show me your best face, okay?

33:35.000 --> 33:37.000
Looks like you're hurting, huh?

33:37.840 --> 33:40.670
It's okay, I won't hit you, so you can say anything.

33:41.180 --> 33:45.750
Dumbass....you, why didn't you say anything?!

33:50.670 --> 33:55.260
Stop it okay, Juu, nothing would have changed even if I told you.

33:55.330 --> 33:58.950
Don't just decide to give up! If you don't try you won't know right?!

33:59.780 --> 34:02.300
Then it would have been fine if I asked for help?

34:02.420 --> 34:05.860
Right. Because you're a pitiful person!

34:06.310 --> 34:09.840
For a person like that, it's a given to ask anyone for help!

34:14.950 --> 34:17.430
I...am not like a king.

34:18.670 --> 34:21.340
I'm weak. I don't want loneliness.

34:21.000 --> 34:27.000
No! Juu wouldn't say things like that! This isn't like you!

34:22.140 --> 34:26.180
This hardness or pain either, I don't want to die like this!

34:27.310 --> 34:29.150
I'm pathetic, and I can say it many times.

34:30.000 --> 34:34.350
I'm scared. I'm lonely! I don't want to die!

34:35.210 --> 34:37.110
Anyone....save me!

34:37.440 --> 34:39.250
Understood, Lord Juu!

34:40.000 --> 34:40.760
You!

34:48.460 --> 34:50.000
My apologies for being late.

34:50.550 --> 34:53.060
Good thing you knew I was here

34:53.890 --> 34:55.150
It's the entirety of our bonds.

34:56.710 --> 34:59.000
So you had something like this...

34:59.630 --> 35:04.760
I have a friend who is knowledgeable in these things and got one for the sake of protecting you, Lord Juu.

35:09.250 --> 35:10.770
Why are you interferring?

35:11.530 --> 35:14.400
Just when I thought I could end things well with Juu...

35:15.000 --> 35:16.000
It was important...

35:17.440 --> 35:21.890
I'm Lord Juu's Knight. When he's in danger I save him. It's a given.

35:23.610 --> 35:27.220
From the start, Ochibana, you were weird.

35:27.950 --> 35:30.230
Some nonsense is entering your brain...you're broken!

35:30.750 --> 35:32.830
You are exactly the same.

35:35.110 --> 35:36.810
So we're grouped together..

35:37.230 --> 35:39.950
Satsuki Miya, I will eliminate you.

35:40.000 --> 35:42.860
You're the one that's going to be eliminated!

35:45.120 --> 35:45.590
Ame!!

35:48.770 --> 35:49.550
Lord Juu!!

36:02.110 --> 36:04.730
Are you a little...satisfied?

36:05.330 --> 36:06.950
Juu......

36:07.550 --> 36:08.350
Dumbass....

36:20.480 --> 36:22.680
It's wrong....this is wrong!

36:22.690 --> 36:24.000
Juu, you're wrong!

36:24.800 --> 36:27.500
This is-- believe me-- I...I...really--

36:28.880 --> 36:29.510
Lord Juu!

36:30.980 --> 36:33.800
You can't die! I just finally met you...

36:35.150 --> 36:37.420
We were going to be together from now on!

36:38.430 --> 36:40.730
Lord Juu, I don't want you to die!

36:40.990 --> 36:43.990
I don't want you to die, Lord Juu!

36:44.330 --> 36:46.000
Don't die!!

37:36.800 --> 37:37.980
Hey, Ame?

37:38.930 --> 37:42.250
Between spring days and rainy days, which do you prefer?

37:43.910 --> 37:46.480
Long ago, I liked rainy days.

37:46.990 --> 37:49.960
It felt like they were days made for me.

37:51.230 --> 37:53.720
But that was a wrong guess.

37:54.410 --> 37:59.450
Before long, I came to understand that those feelings were just meant to disappear.

37:59.640 --> 38:00.900
I wanted to cry.

38:01.700 --> 38:05.660
That's why, on rainy days, those feelings are complex.

38:09.210 --> 38:10.860
Hey, Ochibana Ame.

38:12.820 --> 38:16.000
Am I still thought of as your master?

38:16.610 --> 38:17.540
Of course.

38:18.210 --> 38:22.470
Looking that pathetic as I begged for my life, while you saved me...

38:23.540 --> 38:24.330
Yet still?

38:25.070 --> 38:26.250
Naturally.

38:27.050 --> 38:29.440
For that, I am here.

38:33.750 --> 38:37.270
You're an idiot, aren't you? Being with me; what's so fun about it?

38:38.200 --> 38:39.050
Various reasons <3

38:42.310 --> 38:45.340
Oh well, you can be with me until you give up.

38:46.140 --> 38:47.790
I'll play along with it until I give up too.

38:48.050 --> 38:48.450
Yes!

38:48.970 --> 38:50.320
So, where are we going?

38:51.640 --> 38:54.380
I'm free today. I hoped to go along with you.

38:54.900 --> 38:55.530
Where do you want to go?

38:56.000 --> 38:59.480
No, that--please don't mind me.

38:59.520 --> 39:01.910
It's fine. Say it.

39:02.720 --> 39:06.570
Yes...then...Shibuya--

39:06.690 --> 39:07.860
Want to look at clothes?

39:08.300 --> 39:14.620
Umm...there's a used bookstore...manga and other things...

39:15.040 --> 39:16.810
Understood. I'll go.

39:31.910 --> 39:43.120
It was painful as I dived in the swirl of delusions.

39:43.340 --> 39:54.000
The aurora appeared before I opened my eyes

39:54.760 --> 40:00.000
"You can pass through this cold cold winter"

40:00.500 --> 40:06.300
someone said inside a distant memory

40:06.310 --> 40:11.870
There is no such as never-ending rain

40:11.890 --> 40:15.000
Right?

40:26.270 --> 40:37.000
Painful; Painful; Can't even draw an ideal.

40:37.630 --> 40:48.690
Time and tears freeze...resignation will cover us.

40:49.020 --> 40:54.240
Escaping isn't a bad thing at all

40:54.850 --> 41:00.450
Pour a little bit of love for yourself

41:00.840 --> 41:06.210
Someone shouting in the fading consciousness

41:06.210 --> 41:11.460
God, it's you. Right?!

41:11.870 --> 41:17.000
The time you get out of this long suffering

41:17.810 --> 41:23.000
The sun will light only for you

41:23.450 --> 41:28.750
Don't grieve if the road trips your feet

41:29.000 --> 41:34.410
The sun will wait only for you
